# a whole script (886): a template filled in, each {{key}} replaced by its value, by sed
var values [name: Ada  lang: "the command model"  year: 2026]
var text "Dear {{name}},\nthanks for trying {{lang}} in {{year}}.\n"
for k @(keys $values) {
    set text $(printf '%s' $text | sed "s/{{$k}}/$values[$k]/g")
}
printf '%s\n' $text
